        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique for real estate — the process of adding furniture and decor to listing photos: an interior designer furnishes empty or cleared rooms in the image so buyers can judge scale and layout, without any physical furniture entering the house. Bella's designers stage Dallas–Fort Worth listings in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo.",
