            "answer": "Bella virtual staging is {price:virtual-staging} per photo anywhere in Dallas–Fort Worth, with volume discounts of 5% at 3+ photos, 10% at 6+, 15% at 11+ and 20% at 21+. Furniture removal, unlimited revisions for two weeks and full usage rights are included. Physical staging, by comparison, generally runs $2,000–5,000 a month."
