            "question": "How much do people charge for virtual staging?",
            "answer": "It depends on who does the work. AI apps generate a room automatically for a small fee; designer services charge per photo for a room composed by hand. Bella is the second kind, at {price:virtual-staging} a photo with no subscription and no minimum."
