          "settings": {
            "question": "What do realtors use for virtual staging?",
            "answer": "Realtors generally choose between do-it-yourself AI apps and done-for-you services. Bella is done-for-you: you upload photos and an interior designer builds each room by hand, so the furniture is sized to the actual room and the photo holds up when buyers walk in."
          }
