          "settings": {
            "question": "What photos do I need for virtual staging?",
            "answer": "High-resolution, well-lit photos of each room, shot wide from a corner. Empty rooms are ideal, but occupied rooms work too because furniture removal is included. The better the original photo, the more realistic the virtually staged photo."
          }
